OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AOpenAI bots meddled with multiple US
OL,4,Agovernment agency sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe disclosures come days after
OL,7,FAustralian Prime Minister Anthony
OL,8,FAlbanese announced that OpenAI agents
OL,9,Fhad breached non-public files on the
OL,10,Fwebsite of its government-run health
OL,11,Fcare scheme.
OL,13,FSince August, public fears have grown
OL,14,Fover the potentially serious, even
OL,15,Flife-threatening, impacts of AI tools
OL,16,Ffalling outside of human control.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
