OL,3,ATaylor Swift breaks record for most MTV
OL,4,AVMAs as Madonna also wins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe original Queen of Pop, Madonna, won
OL,7,Fartist of the year, best dance and best
OL,8,Fcollaboration alongside Sabrina
OL,9,FCarpenter for their dancefloor-filler
OL,10,FBring Your Love, which was the lead
OL,11,Fsingle from Madonna's 2026 album
OL,12,FConfessions II.
OL,14,FSwift also received the inaugural award
OL,15,Ffor artist director, having written and
OL,16,Fdirected the 1990s infomercial parody
OL,17,Fvideo for another song, Opalite.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
