OL,3,AAngela Scanlon takes over Sara Cox's
OL,4,Adrivetime slot on Radio 2
OL,5,
OL,6,FScanlon, who hosted a Sunday early
OL,7,Fmorning programme on the station from
OL,8,F2018 to 2021, was among a number of
OL,9,Fpeople who filled in after Cox vacated
OL,10,Fthe drivetime slot in May, including
OL,11,FJoel Dommett, Jason Manford, Ellie
OL,12,FTaylor, Alex Jones and Gary Davies.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
